stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> loading: Open Documents
  loading: Loading documents
  ready_below_cap: Documents visible, fewer than 500
  loading_more: Documents visible, loading next page
  ready_at_cap: 500 documents visible, limit notice when more exist
  unavailable_retry: Documents unavailable, retry offered
  expired: Session expired, documents removed
  disposed: Panel closed
  loading --> loading: Delayed reply
  loading --> ready_below_cap: Valid first page
  loading --> unavailable_retry: Failure or invalid page
  ready_below_cap --> loading_more: Load more
  loading_more --> loading_more: Delayed reply
  loading_more --> ready_below_cap: Valid page leaves fewer than 500
  loading_more --> ready_at_cap: Valid page reaches or crosses 500, accept remaining rows
  loading_more --> unavailable_retry: Failure, duplicate document or repeated cursor
  unavailable_retry --> loading_more: Retry the failed next page
  unavailable_retry --> loading: Retry first page or refresh
  ready_below_cap --> loading: Refresh
  ready_at_cap --> loading: Refresh
  loading --> expired: Session invalidated or authorization refused
  loading_more --> expired: Session invalidated or authorization refused
  ready_below_cap --> expired: Session invalidated
  ready_at_cap --> expired: Session invalidated
  unavailable_retry --> expired: Session invalidated
  loading --> disposed: Close panel
  loading_more --> disposed: Close panel
  ready_below_cap --> disposed: Close panel
  ready_at_cap --> disposed: Close panel
  unavailable_retry --> disposed: Close panel
  expired --> disposed: Close panel
  expired --> expired: Delayed reply ignored
  disposed --> disposed: Delayed reply ignored
  %% never Render or retain more than 500 accepted documents.
  %% never Request another page after 500 documents are accepted.
  %% never Accept duplicate IDs or cyclic cursors, including discarded rows.
